"Plan travel moves such that the extruder avoids areas where the filament may "
"be curled up. This is mostly happening on steeper rounded overhangs and may "
"cause a crash with the nozzle. This feature slows down both the print and "
"the G-code generation."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:142
msgid "Avoid crossing perimeters"
msgstr "Evitar cruzamento de perímetros"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Optimize travel moves in order to minimize the crossing of perimeters. This "
"is mostly useful with Bowden extruders which suffer from oozing. This "
"feature slows down both the print and the G-code generation."
msgstr ""
"Otimize os movimentos de deslocamento para minimizar o cruzamento de "
"perímetros. Isto é principalmente útil com extrusoras Bowden que sofrem de "
"escorrimento. Este recurso retarda a impressão e a geração de G-code."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:155
msgid "Avoid crossing perimeters - Max detour length"
msgstr "Evitar cruzamento de perímetros - Comprimento máximo do desvio"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:160
msgid ""
"The maximum detour length for avoid crossing perimeters. If the detour is "
"longer than this value, avoid crossing perimeters is not applied for this "
"travel path. "
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:170
msgid "Bed other layers"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:175
msgid ""
"Bed temperature for layers after the first one. Set this to zero to disable "
"bed temperature control commands in the output."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura da mesa para camadas após o primeiro. Defina isso como zero para "
"desabilitar os comandos de controle de temperatura da mesa na saída."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:177
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:195
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:213
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1726
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1929
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4546
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:5075
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:29
msgid "°C"
msgstr "°C"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:178
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Config/ToolToFeatureDialog.cpp:40
msgid "Bed temperature"
msgstr "Temperatura da mesa"

#. TRN: Label of a configuration parameter: Nominal chamber temperature.
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:187
msgid "Chamber nominal temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:192
msgid "Chamber temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:193
msgid ""
"Required chamber temperature for the print.\n"
"When set to zero, the nominal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""

#. TRN: Label of a configuration parameter: Minimal chamber temperature
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:204
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:209
msgid "Chamber minimal temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:210
msgid ""
"Minimal chamber temperature that the printer waits for before the print "
"starts. This allows to start the print before the nominal chamber "
"temperature is reached.\n"
"When set to zero, the minimal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:221
msgid "Bed temperature by extruder"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:226
msgid ""
"The extruder which determines bed temperatures. Set to 0 to determine "
"temperatures based on the first printing extruder of the first and the "
"second layers."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:239
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted at every layer change, right before the Z move. "
"Note that you can use placeholder variables for all PrusaSlicer settings as "
"well as [layer_num] and [layer_z]."
msgstr ""
"Esse código personalizado é inserido em cada alteração de camada, logo antes "
"da movimentação Z. Observe que você pode usar variáveis de espaço reservado "
"para todas as config. PrusaSlicer, bem como [layer_num] e [layer_z]."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:249
msgid "Between objects G-code"
msgstr "G-code entre objetos"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:254
msgid ""
"This code is inserted between objects when using sequential printing. By "
"default extruder and bed temperature are reset using non-wait command; "
"however if M104, M109, M140 or M190 are detected in this custom code, "
"PrusaSlicer will not add temperature commands. Note that you can use "
"placeholder variables for all PrusaSlicer settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"Esse código é inserido entre objetos ao usar a impressão sequencial. Por "
"padrão, a extrusora e a temperatura da mesa são redefinidas usando o comando "
"não esperar; no entanto, se M104, M109, M140 ou M190 são detectados neste "
"código personalizado, PrusaSlicer não adicionará comandos de temperatura. "
"Observe que você pode usar variáveis de espaço reservado para todas as "
"config. de PrusaSlicer, para que você possa colocar um comando \"M109 S "
"[temperatura_primeira_camada]\" onde quiser."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:263
msgid "Bottom solid layers"
msgstr "Camadas sólidas inferiores"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:269
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on bottom surfaces."
msgstr "Número de camadas sólidas para gerar em superfícies inferiores."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:281
msgid ""
"The number of bottom solid layers is increased above bottom_solid_layers if "
"necessary to satisfy minimum thickness of bottom shell."
msgstr ""
"O número de camadas sólidas inferiores é aumentado acima de "
"bottom_solid_layers se necessário para satisfazer a espessura mínima da "
"camada inferior."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:283
msgid "Minimum bottom shell thickness"
msgstr "Espessura mínima da casca inferior"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:291
msgid "Bridge"
msgstr "Ponte"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:296
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for bridges. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for bridges."
msgstr ""
"Esta é a aceleração que sua impressora usará para pontes. Defina zero para "
"desabilitar o controle de aceleração para pontes."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:298
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:741
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1697
